### Node.js path module

### path.dirname

#### gets directory name

- Verify: gets directory name
   - Expected: _str(path_dirname([JsValue.String(v: "/usr/local/bin/node")])) equals `/usr/local/bin`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 3 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: gets directory name")
# @req: REQ-FEATURE-NodeApiConf-001
expect(_str(path_dirname([JsValue.String(v: "/usr/local/bin/node")]))).to_equal("/usr/local/bin")
```

</details>

