#### rejects bounded http request writes after terminal state

- Verify: rejects bounded http request writes after terminal state
   - Expected: _eval_str_with_network("http://api.example.com:8080", "var req = require('http').request('http://api.example.com:8080'); req.writeRejected + ':' + req.writeRejectReason") equals `false:`
